# A small leaf-spine fabric for lab.sh (FABRIC=fabric.topo.example).
#
#   switch <name>                 a switch VM (up to 15 letters/digits/-/_)
#   link <a> <b> <Mbit/s>         a virtual cable; a and b are switches or
#                                 HOSTS from lab.conf; capacity per direction,
#                                 used by the plugin's path computation
#
# Any connected graph works. Hosts are never transit, so a host may be
# dual-homed (two links to two leaves).
#
#        spine1      spine2
#          |  \     /  |
#          |    \ /    |
#          |    / \    |
#        leaf1       leaf2
#        /   \          \
#     node1  node2     node3

switch spine1
switch spine2
switch leaf1
switch leaf2

link spine1 leaf1 1000
link spine1 leaf2 1000
link spine2 leaf1 1000
link spine2 leaf2 1000

link leaf1 node1 1000
link leaf1 node2 1000
link leaf2 node3 1000
